OL,3,GNEWSAReviving a 200-year-old ale recipe
OL,4,Amade in a teapot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe descendant of a brewer who made the
OL,7,Ffirst commercially successful India
OL,8,FPale Ale (IPA) has revived his
OL,9,Fseven-times-great-grandfather's recipe.
OL,11,FSamuel Allsopp created the beer in a
OL,12,Fteapot in 1822 after being challenged
OL,13,Fto make one which would last the
OL,14,Fsix-month sea journey to India.
OL,16,FAllsopp went on to help establish
OL,17,FBurton-upon-Trent, Staffordshire, as
OL,18,Fthe world's brewing capital.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
