OL,3,GNEWSAReviving a 200-year-old ale recipe
OL,4,Amade in a teapot
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Holt, owner of Kirkstall Brewery
OL,7,Fin Leeds, found the leather-bound
OL,8,Fbrewery ledger containing the recipe
OL,9,Fand teamed up with Allsopp's descendent
OL,10,FJamie Allsopp to remake what they
OL,11,Fcalled "one of the most important beers
OL,12,Fin brewing history."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
